   "t0": 0.8,
   "t1": 5.6,
   "y": 516,
   "size": 19
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "en": "Then it became beads on a wire.",
   "zh": "后来，它变成了算盘上的珠子。",
   "text": "后来它变",
   "t0": 5.9,
   "t1": 10.6,
   "y": 516,
   "size": 19
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "en": "Machines of iron learned to add.",
   "zh": "钢铁的机器，学会了加法。",
